# 中屏 (an opened fold upright), a finger: two chats chosen in turn from the sidebar, then the sidebar's list dragged.
system {"size_class":{"width":"medium","height":"medium"}}
timeout 20000
until 新建对话
wait 500
log measure
tap 夜里的构建又失败了
wait 1000
tap 首页的列表改成按天分组
wait 1000
dragon 0 -300 400 整理发布清单
wait 1200
exit
